DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:HS4.10 Advertise the call for abstracts\, round 1
DESCRIPTION:EGU advertises the conference\, not single sessions\, and give
 s out no mailing lists. Promotion is up to us.\nChannels: the HEPEX commu
 nity\, hydrology and forecasting mailing lists\, our institutes\, partner
  projects\, LinkedIn\, Bluesky and X.\nQuote both deadlines: support appl
 ications 1 Dec 2026\, 13:00 CET\; abstracts 12 Jan 2027\, 13:00 CET.\nSiz
 e guide: about 15–22 abstracts fill one oral time block. Sessions with 
 5 or fewer abstracts are cancelled.\n\nTeam target (suggested date)\nEGU2
 7 home: https://www.egu27.eu/\n\nChecklist: https://rafael3442.github.io/
 egu27-hs410/
URL:https://rafael3442.github.io/egu27-hs410/
END:VEVENT
