 iliation). An automatic check uses it to award the session's EDI logo.\nR
 ead the convener guidelines and agree to the EGU code of conduct.\n\nTeam
  target (suggested date)\nEGU27 dashboard: https://meetingorganizer.coper
 nicus.org/EGU27/dashboard\nPersonal data options: https://administrator.c
