SUMMARY:HS4.10 Team kick-off call: split the roles
DESCRIPTION:Agree who leads each job: advertising\, the solicited speaker 
 and TAN\, support-application ratings\, abstract review in January\, OSPP
  judges\, chairing in Vienna.\nConfirm which convener is the session's OS
 PP contact (named in the proposal).\nDecide on extras: a special issue (f
 or example HESS\, NHESS or ADGEO)\, a splinter or townhall meeting.\nWrit
 e the owners into this page (the owner field in index.html) so everyone s
 ees them.\n\nTeam target (suggested date)\n\nChecklist: https://rafael344
 2.github.io/egu27-hs410/
URL:https://rafael3442.github.io/egu27-hs410/
