DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:HS4.10 Invite the solicited speaker and send the TAN
DESCRIPTION:At most one solicited abstract per time block. Conveners canno
 t be solicited speakers in their own session.\nGenerate the session's TAN
  from the session overview when logged in\, and send it straight to the s
 peaker. Extra TANs only through the programme group chair.\nThe TAN lets 
 the speaker submit a second first-author abstract (one regular plus one s
 olicited).\nSolicited speakers get no fee discount or travel support. Sen
 d the TAN early.\n\nTeam target (suggested date)\nEGU27 dashboard: https:
 //meetingorganizer.copernicus.org/EGU27/dashboard\n\nChecklist: https://r
 afael3442.github.io/egu27-hs410/
URL:https://rafael3442.github.io/egu27-hs410/
END:VEVENT
