DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:HS4.10 SOI: review abstracts\, decide on mergers
DESCRIPTION:Read every abstract in HS4.10 and those suggested for transfer
  into it. Look closely at abstracts the system flags.\nNo AI tools for re
 view\, and no abstract text pasted into them.\nTick ‘public interest’
  on a few abstracts suited to general attendees.\nMergers: inform the Hyd
 rological Sciences programme group chair first\; agree title\, descriptio
 n and conveners\; move and accept the abstracts\; then withdraw the empti
 ed session. Tell authors of transferred abstracts and give them time to c
 hoose another session.\n\nEGU date\nConvener guidelines: https://www.egu2
 7.eu/conveners/convener-guidelines.html\n\nChecklist: https://rafael3442.
 github.io/egu27-hs410/
URL:https://rafael3442.github.io/egu27-hs410/
