  questions and changeover included. Up to 3 subtitles per time block.\nGi
 ve the solicited talk a 10\, 20 or 30 minute slot (one per time block).\n
 Name at least two chairpersons per time block\, both on site.\nOptional: 
 list the solicited speaker at the end of the session description.\n\nEGU 
 date\nSession modification tool: https://meetingorganizer.copernicus.org/
 EGU27/sessionmodification/59896\n\nChecklist: https://rafael3442.github.i
 o/egu27-hs410/
